oculate-welcome-title-line1 = ברוך בואך אל
oculate-welcome-title-line2 = אינטרנט רגוע יותר
oculate-welcome-back = Back
oculate-welcome-skip = Skip for now
oculate-welcome-import-title = התחלה חדשה, אותן סימניות
oculate-welcome-import-description = Pick a browser to import your bookmarks, history and passwords from and pick up right where you left off.
oculate-welcome-import-no = <strong>NO</strong>, start fresh.
oculate-welcome-default-browser-title = Make { -brand-short-name } your default?
oculate-welcome-default-browser-description = Links from other apps will open in { -brand-short-name }. You can always change this later.
oculate-welcome-set-default-browser = <strong>YES</strong>, make { -brand-short-name } default.
oculate-welcome-dont-set-default-browser = <strong>NO</strong>, still exploring my options.
oculate-welcome-default-search-title = מנוע חיפוש ברירת מחדל
oculate-welcome-default-search-description = נא לבחור מנוע החיפוש ברירת מחדל. תמיד ניתן לשנות הגדרה זו!
oculate-welcome-essentials-title = Choose the apps you use most.
oculate-welcome-essentials-description = Select your favorite apps to keep them handy in your sidebar.
oculate-welcome-block-ads-title = Block ads and trackers?
oculate-welcome-block-ads-description = { -brand-short-name } can install uBlock Origin for you, so pages load cleaner and faster. You can remove it any time.
oculate-welcome-block-ads-yes = <strong>YES</strong>, block ads for me.
oculate-welcome-block-ads-no = <strong>NO</strong>, show me everything.
oculate-welcome-workspace-colors-title = מרחבי העבודה שלך, בצבעים שלך
oculate-welcome-workspace-colors-description = אפשר להתאים אישית את הדפדפן שלך ולתת לכל מרחב עבודה צבע ייחודי.
oculate-welcome-start-browsing-title = All set? Let’s get rolling!
oculate-welcome-start-browsing-description-1 = הכול מוגדר והדפדפן מוכן לשימוש. יש ללחוץ על הכפתור למטה בשביל להתחיל לגלוש עם { -brand-short-name }.
oculate-welcome-start-browsing = מתחילים!
